  "title": "MODI|BODI",
  "subtitle": "tossa de mar, spain · campaign",
  "intro": "A summer campaign for Modibodi, shot on location in Tossa de Mar on the Costa Brava — in and around Hotel Reymar, then out through the town's beaches and back streets.\n\nThe brief was ease. Swimwear and period underwear photographed the way they're actually worn: salt water, hot stone, wet hair, an afternoon that runs long. No studio, no staging — just strong midday light and a coastline doing most of the work.",
